; Object Start Sequence
G91   		; relative positioning mode
G0 Z10		; move up to avoid collisions
G90   		; absolute positioning mode
M83 		; extruder relative mode
G0 X0.00 F10000;  move to wiping X/Y position
G0 Y0.00

